    "body": "Good point, that would be unnecessarily messy. Your current structure is good then. Still, should we fix IntersectionObserver at the same time, or just go ahead and merge this as-is? I don't think we can call #7931 closed until we fix all three though, right?\r\n\r\n(And maybe we should make Web Animations consistent?? Or maybe that's another can of worms; https://drafts.csswg.org/web-animations-1/#document-timelines looks pretty different from the usual infrastructure.)",
